        <mxCell id="Rhe0-Jxv2hhzxxwk4ome-81" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Search our &lt;b&gt;internal database&lt;/b&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;-&amp;nbsp; where do we find trees?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- where do I find {attribute 1: tree height}?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- where do I find&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;{attribute 2:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;trees last trim date}?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- where do I find&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;{attribute 3:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;trees geometry? }&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;- How can I connect them all? attribute join, spatial join, etc?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;- [road map feature] Do we need ETL or Statistical operations ? for example aggregating columns, mean, average, median,...?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1773.75" y="2060" width="182.5" height="210" as="geometry" />
