        <mxCell id="Rhe0-Jxv2hhzxxwk4ome-84" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 204, 0); background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;[Roadmap Feature]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;For each missing data:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;search directory of trusted &lt;b&gt;external sources&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;answer same questions:&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;-&amp;nbsp; where do we find trees?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- where do I find {attribute 1: tree height}?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- where do I find&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;{attribute 2:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;trees last trim date}?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- where do I find&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;{attribute 3:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;trees geometry? }&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;- How can I connect them all? attribute join, spatial join, etc?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=12 12;" parent="1" vertex="1">
